<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Select the Active Test item [Circuit Relay] from [Diagnosis Menu] → [Active Test].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Measure the voltage of the fuel suction tube assembly vehicle side connector terminals when the Active Test is performed.</ptxt>
<spec>
